WEBVTT

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.990
Listen, Kitaro-chan.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.240
Yoko-san has no one else...

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:29.580
Could you guys make this
a special day for her?

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.210
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
