<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:28.200
What?!

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:29.200
This is...?!

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.200
Why?!

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:31.200
What the...?!

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:33.700
Wally Wall!

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.910
Who could have expected this?

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:43.420
-That Rat Man... Rat Man is...
-Oh my cotton.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.050
Getting married?!

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.050
<i>"You are cordially invited to..."</i>

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:49.840
MARRIAGE

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.050
CHAPTER 24

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:55.850
RAT MAN'S DISAPPEARANCE?! SEKIYO'S TRAP

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:59.350
I can't believe he beat me.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.520
Beat you at what?

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:03.770
N-Nothing!

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:09.610
Well, anyone who'd marry someone as ugly
as Rat Man must by pretty ugly themselves!

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:13.240
Love isn't just
falling for someone's looks.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.490
It's what's inside that counts.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.870
Rat Man's ugly on the inside, too!

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.450
Oh!

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:24.460
My family, thank you for coming!

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:25.590
Huh?

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:26.710
A tuxedo.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.260
Talk about ill-suited.

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:30.010
Hey!

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:31.760
What's with the looks?

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.800
Oh, uh, it's nothing...

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:38.140
Forget it!
My family, allow me to introduce you!

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.140
This is my bride...

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:45.860
My name is Yoko Ishiyama.

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:53.030
R-Rat Man, how did you
trick someone this beautiful?!

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.530
Give me a little more respect!

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.160
One day...

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:00.080
<i>Bibibi no bi</i>

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.800
PAWN SHOP

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.800
<i>That was the start.</i>

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:12.010
Not a bad job there.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.930
Listen, Kitaro-chan.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.850
Yoko-san has no one else...

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:21.270
Could you guys make this
a special day for her?

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:24.440
-I'm counting on you!
-R-Right.

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:30.570
You can think of me as your older sister
from now on, Catchick-san.

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:31.690
What?!

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:35.530
He already told me.
That you're his number one sidekick.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.780
S-S-Sidekick?!

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:41.790
And that you're jealous I took
the boss you so admire.

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.090
<i>This okay?</i>

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.920
<i>I'm guessin' it'll work out?</i>

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.590
<i>Bride human.</i>

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:59.760
I mean, Rat Man's half-human,
half-<i>yokai</i> after all.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:04.480
There's cases where it's worked.
His existence is proof.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:06.810
Hmm.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.360
TO HONEKAWA HOT SPRINGS

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.360
It work out.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.730
Me hope.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.740
Hooray! Hooray!

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:18.570
Hooray!! Hooray!!

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:20.910
<i>It'll never work out.</i>

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:25.460
Honey, the water's perfect.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:27.170
R-Really?

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.960
Th-That's g-good to hear.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.300
Why don't you join me in here?

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.420
Oh, hot water makes me feel ill.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.260
Ouch!

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:42.930
It's not a dream. I really got married.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.320
Um...!

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.660
Sorry.

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:03.330
You go first.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:09.080
Thanks for being with a guy like me.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:10.960
I promise!

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.960
I swear I'll make you happy!

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:19.890
Th-This is m-my first time doing
s-s-something like this...

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.550
Don't worry.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:23.350
Relax.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:25.720
Relax.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.570
See you later!

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.030
Good luck at work.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.110
Wanna get a drink tonight?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:42.570
Sorry, the wife's expecting me.

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:45.160
Have you decided on a name for the baby?

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:47.870
Well, the wife and I have been
arguing over it.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:53.170
I wanna give it a nice, spirited name.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:57.840
My wife says a plain name is fine
and what matters is how it's written.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:03.890
The baths were wonderful.
Let's come again some time.

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:06.810
We'll need you to stay healthy for that.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.440
I see. Thanks for checking.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.860
Apparently they left the hotel long ago.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:22.200
Hmm. Where could Rat Man
have disappeared to?

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:24.950
There's been no word for a while.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.370
Rat Man, where're ya at?!

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.670
-Oh! There he is!
-Huh? Where? Where?

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.050
Wedding or honeymoon or whatever.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:42.010
At least bring the interest.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:46.560
Rat Man!

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:50.680
Everyone's been lookin' for ya.
What happened at the--

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:51.940
Huh?!

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.230
Ya really lost weight.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:00.610
Oh! These wounds!

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:03.700
There's no mistake.
This is the Sekiyo's doing!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:05.120
The Sekiyo...

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:09.490
She's a <i>yokai</i> who would appear at quarries
and seduce men.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.790
Oh, mister, you're so tense.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.630
When massaged, they would fall asleep,

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.710
leaving the Sekiyo to
do whatever she pleased.

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:25.220
So you borrowed money for a wedding
with someone like that?!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:28.850
And she even made off with the gift money!

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:34.600
Well, when you think about it,
you probably got off lucky.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:42.860
Here! I'll at least cover the interest!

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.570
Get a grip!

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.000
Ow! What was that for?!

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:04.680
She targeted you without any money

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:07.260
because you told
some wild story again, right?!

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.640
It's your own fault!

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:10.260
Wh-Why you!

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:13.230
Am I the one you should yell at?!
Of course not!

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:18.230
She took everything, had her fun, and
you're going to mope without getting even?

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.230
Pathetic!

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.990
S-Sure I'd like to...

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:28.780
I-I'd like to...!

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.960
I'll find the Sekiyo for you.

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:43.800
At this rate,
there could be even more victims!

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:45.920
Catchick...

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.550
Get moving!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.600
You're searching too!

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.560
R-...

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:53.850
Right!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.650
This is the Sekiyo's!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:02.480
What are you doing?

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:05.900
"Yoko's victims"...

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:08.530
"Requesting info. Please share."

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:12.580
You know what they say, right?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:15.160
VICTIM A

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:15.160
A beautiful rose has thorns!

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.500
VICTIM B

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:17.500
My wife divorced me...

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:20.080
My retirement savings are gone.

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:20.080
VICTIM C

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.290
VICTIM D

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:22.290
Women are monsters!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:25.050
VICTIM E

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.050
Yoko! Come back to me!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:30.300
I can't believe how many people
the Sekiyo tricked besides you.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:33.560
-Hey!
-Yes?

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:34.890
Here.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.140
<i>"I agree to sue Yoko Ishiyama."</i>

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:36.140
I-Is this...?

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:40.400
Every one of her victims is going to
sue her for all she's worth.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.110
Here. Sign it.

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:44.020
R-Right...

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:49.280
Count me out.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.490
Huh?

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:55.120
Even after all this,
I can't bring myself to hate her.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.120
I know it seems idiotic.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.630
He's such an idiot!

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.250
Dammit, it's so frustrating!

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:08.130
Men are too weak against
women with nice bodies! Honestly!

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:11.130
Ma'am! Give me another
strawberry milk shaved ice!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:09.630
PRODUCER AKIMURA'S AFFAIR?!

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:21.480
Just so we're clear,
you're covering all the expenses for--

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:23.150
Huh?

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.230
He's gone...

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.950
-Mr. Akimura, please comment!
-What did you say to your wife?!

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:32.410
Akimura-san, please say something!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:35.160
I'm sorry...

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:39.580
Because of me, your reputation is...

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:41.710
Don't worry, Yoko-kun.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.750
I have status and money...

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.630
and love.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:48.380
Oh my!

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:51.510
I'll use my strength to protect y--

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:02.020
NICE WATER

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:06.520
LET'S ALL SING TOGETHER

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:05.520
-<i>"Ge."</i>
-<i>"Ge."</i>

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:06.520
<i>"Ge."</i>

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.200
Get out of here.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.450
Hurry before Kitaro
and the others find you!

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:22.330
Are you sure?

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.710
Yeah! H-Hurry and go!

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:40.470
I'm sorry...

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:45.400
for tricking someone as kind as you...

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:49.650
I'm a terrible woman.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:50.650
Y-...

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.070
Y-...

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.070
Yoko...

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:56.240
Relax.

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:58.830
Relax.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.180
He's as poor as ever.

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:16.640
Sekiyo!

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.440
You twisted woman!

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:28.730
You're still mad that
I took the boss you admire.

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:31.280
No, that's all a lie! A made-up story!

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:36.780
You'll pay for this! How dare ya
take advantage of Rat Man's sincerity!

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:39.660
N-No forgive!

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:43.040
Sekiyo, it's time to pay the piper.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.580
Oh really?

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:46.080
In that case...!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:54.880
Oh no!

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:57.220
Split up and find her!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.260
Hey!

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:03.810
Sekiyo, stop!

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.560
This is a cruel marathon for the elderly!

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:08.520
How pathetic!

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:17.360
Got you! Give it up!

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:23.120
What a nice body!

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.210
You old lecher! What are you doing?!

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.710
Let go!

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:32.170
Sorry about that!

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:35.710
Your capture technique is indecent!

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.510
Don't fall behind, Catchick!

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:43.350
Who's falling behind?!

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:45.770
There!

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.560
You! Prepare yourself!

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:55.030
This is for Rat Man!

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:01.490
Huh?!

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.120
Run, Yoko!

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:07.200
H-Hurry! Yoko, run!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.750
Let go, dammit!

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.130
What in the world are you doing?!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.590
Get back here!

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:23.680
You won't escape, Sekiyo!

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.470
Hair Needles!

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:31.600
Huh?!

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:40.240
Hmm.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.660
She defended herself by turning to stone.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.160
But this is the end.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:50.540
She copied my trick!

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:53.630
It'll be difficult to carry her.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.840
Me got this.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.880
Trick men!

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.840
Bad woman!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.930
Have enough?!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.350
Take that!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:16.900
Stupid rat! I can't believe you!

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:28.240
What?!

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:37.670
Ow!

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:38.800
Ouch!

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:44.890
Hey, Kitaro, hold on!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:54.270
Wally... Wall...

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:59.070
Terrifyin'!

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:01.190
-Rollo Cloth!
-Wh-Wh-What?!

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:03.030
Give me a lift!

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.950
Cotton copies!

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.490
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:12.000
It's no good!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.250
Curse you, Kitaro!

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:29.600
Oh crap!

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.900
I'll suck you in!

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:41.610
Kitaro, what do we do?!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:43.360
Head straight!

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:49.200
She's gonna swallow us!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:51.660
You won't get away from me!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:55.750
Umi-Bozu!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:10.010
Thanks a lot, Umi-Bozu!

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:28.780
Sekiyo or whatever,
you can't beat the ocean.

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:33.120
No! Let go of me!

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:40.250
Little more carefully.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.130
Don't be picky!

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:45.380
Now then...

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:49.130
What should we do with that nasty woman?

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:50.800
Let me have her.

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:53.680
I'll keep her as a pet for a while.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:56.850
Let go! Let go of me!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:59.900
No! Let go!

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.900
Rat Man!

00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:12.530
Rat Man-san! You came for me!

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:16.200
Please help me!
I promise I'll be good from now on!

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.790
What a blatant lie!

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:20.580
She just doesn't give up.

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:24.130
Please! Believe me, I'll change my ways!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.710
Please!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:28.760
I'll be taking her.

00:19:29.090 --> 00:19:32.300
I love you!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.930
That's enough, you--

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:36.680
Mister Umi-Bozu!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:40.640
Could you let her go free?

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:46.730
What?

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:49.570
I'm telling you to let her go free!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.320
What did you say?

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.990
If you're not going to...

00:19:57.490 --> 00:20:00.660
I'll fight you!

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:12.760
<i>The Sekiyo didn't even give
a word of thanks!</i>

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:16.390
She was ugly after all.
Her personality was ugly, too!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:19.640
Well, not that I don't get it.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:22.730
With that dynamite body...!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.860
You want me to kiss you instead?!

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:28.360
Was this really a good idea?

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:32.070
More men tricked by the Sekiyo
are gonna turn up eventually.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:35.820
If that happens,
we'll go punish her again.

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.120
But...

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:41.910
I never said this,

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:47.540
but she left this behind
without stealing it.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.170
I wonder why...

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:52.050
You're still saying that?
She just forgot to steal it.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:54.090
That's all there is to it.

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:56.890
Yeah. I guess you're right.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:21:00.020
<i>I'd like to believe it.</i>

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:04.650
<i>That maybe the Sekiyo
had a shred of kindness in her.</i>

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:09.940
<i>That maybe Rat Man's feelings
managed to reach her, if only a little.</i>

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:26.750
Come on, pops, just a little more!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:30.500
This is all?! You cheapskate!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:30.750
PAWN SHOP

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.510
Good riddance!

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:34.010
